WEBVTT

00:00:22.710 --> 00:00:25.710
I wish I was dead.

00:00:41.100 --> 00:00:43.850
What was that, Balot?
Did you say something?

00:00:44.730 --> 00:00:46.900
It's nothing, Shell.

00:00:47.150 --> 00:00:52.650
I was just remembering how
you played during the Show today.

00:01:09.250 --> 00:01:11.920
Everything went my way
when I was betting today.

00:01:18.220 --> 00:01:21.060
And I think everything will
keep on going my way.

00:03:32.150 --> 00:03:35.150
We're coming up on Central Park.

00:03:36.150 --> 00:03:37.650
If it turns out to be nothing,
we'll clear out.

00:03:41.410 --> 00:03:46.280
That guy has been taking in runaways
at his house one after another.

00:03:46.280 --> 00:03:49.330
Number of suicides, four.
Number gone missing, two.

00:03:49.830 --> 00:03:52.330
If nothing happens to that girl,
we'll take it as a win.

00:03:53.800 --> 00:03:58.920
Well, the real problem is whether she'll
consent to 09 like we want her to.

00:03:59.510 --> 00:04:02.600
Target has altered course.
Maintain distance.

00:04:02.600 --> 00:04:05.180
If nothing happens, we can return
home without passing his car.

00:04:05.180 --> 00:04:07.300
"If nothing happens," huh?

00:04:08.560 --> 00:04:13.730
The world is more singed around the
edges than you think it is, Oeufcocque.

00:04:18.360 --> 00:04:23.870
Right... I mustn't forget
to start the parking meter.

00:04:46.060 --> 00:04:49.720
Everything that you have lost,
I will give back to you.

00:04:50.560 --> 00:04:53.730
Does that mean you will love me?

00:04:53.730 --> 00:04:56.190
You asked the perfect question.

00:04:56.190 --> 00:05:00.700
The definition of love is "giving."
And love has a set of rules.

00:05:00.700 --> 00:05:05.320
If you obey the rules,
you will continue to be loved.

00:05:10.080 --> 00:05:12.460
Why me?

00:05:13.080 --> 00:05:15.290
You mustn't harbor doubts.

00:05:17.550 --> 00:05:24.970
Do you know what happens to girls
who forget the rules, Balot?

00:05:28.140 --> 00:05:30.720
Oeufcocque, Turn for me.

00:05:37.810 --> 00:05:40.440
Start recording audio and video feeds.

00:05:40.440 --> 00:05:42.400
I already am.

00:05:43.150 --> 00:05:47.620
That's odd. I detect terror mixed in
with the odors coming from that car.

00:05:47.620 --> 00:05:52.460
Explain that so folks without your
special nose can understand.

00:05:52.460 --> 00:05:54.580
Both of them are frightened.

00:05:54.580 --> 00:05:57.420
The man, too? Why?

00:05:57.420 --> 00:05:59.330
It's almost like a death wish.

00:05:59.330 --> 00:06:02.170
He's planning to pull a
double suicide with that girl?

00:06:02.170 --> 00:06:04.840
That is one magnificent psycho.

00:06:05.800 --> 00:06:06.670
Here comes another car!

00:06:07.590 --> 00:06:10.930
You had misgivings about
what you were given.

00:06:11.760 --> 00:06:14.480
But that's all right, Balot.

00:06:14.480 --> 00:06:18.440
My life is rough, your life is rough.
Enough to make me want to die

00:06:19.320 --> 00:06:22.820
No, my memories really WILL die.

00:06:23.320 --> 00:06:26.110
But they can leave something
tangible behind.

00:06:26.110 --> 00:06:29.950
Like these blue diamonds I made
from those girls' ashes.

00:06:34.410 --> 00:06:38.630
Stay just like that.
That's a beautiful sight.

00:06:38.630 --> 00:06:41.420
And you're about to become something
even more beautiful.

00:06:41.920 --> 00:06:47.420
A blue diamond. That's my solution
for girls who break the rules, Balot.

00:06:55.730 --> 00:06:58.230
What the hell? That's Boiled!

00:06:58.230 --> 00:07:00.810
I can't believe he's working for Shell.

00:07:01.520 --> 00:07:04.940
The man's scent has changed.
It's now one of murderous intent.

00:07:04.940 --> 00:07:07.650
Declare this to be a state of emergency
based on my sense of smell.

00:07:07.860 --> 00:07:09.650
And do what?

00:07:10.620 --> 00:07:13.120
Get moving! Save the girl.

00:07:19.410 --> 00:07:21.210
Why me?

00:07:26.800 --> 00:07:29.050
Die, you bastard!
Drop dead!

00:07:32.310 --> 00:07:35.560
You're scum!
You're nothing but trash!

00:07:35.890 --> 00:07:37.560
Drop dead!

00:07:40.230 --> 00:07:43.440
Josh... Dish...

00:07:49.490 --> 00:07:50.990
Wash...

00:07:52.320 --> 00:07:56.450
Cash... Fish...

00:08:01.750 --> 00:08:03.870
I don't want to die...

00:08:08.670 --> 00:08:13.050
What did I tell you? The world's
more singed than you think it is!

00:08:13.510 --> 00:08:16.720
Try getting cooked in those
flames a little, Oeufcocque!

00:08:16.720 --> 00:08:20.560
I would put out the flames before they
could cook me. That's my usefulness.

00:08:21.440 --> 00:08:24.320
Are you in pain, Mr. Shell?

00:08:24.320 --> 00:08:27.610
It's the A10 surgery I had
when I was a kid.

00:08:27.610 --> 00:08:30.820
When I feel stress, my brain
is hit with a wave of euphoria.

00:08:31.360 --> 00:08:33.660
It was one of the slum
crime prevention measures,

00:08:33.660 --> 00:08:36.320
...but they axed it
when they realized its flaw.

00:08:43.750 --> 00:08:46.420
In my case, it causes memory damage.

00:08:47.210 --> 00:08:50.840
These Heroic Pills are my substitute.

00:08:50.840 --> 00:08:54.140
With these, there's no stress
or side-effects.

00:08:54.140 --> 00:08:56.930
You know how to make the best
of misfortune.

00:08:57.560 --> 00:08:59.140
Indeed I do.

00:08:59.140 --> 00:09:02.430
That's what allows me
to overcome this ritual.

00:09:03.270 --> 00:09:09.940
These beautiful blue diamonds let me climb
the stairway to greatness in this city.

00:09:11.900 --> 00:09:13.650
I've stabilized her for the time being.

00:09:13.650 --> 00:09:16.700
She might be my new partner.
Be gentle with--

00:09:17.490 --> 00:09:18.990
He really did a number on her...

00:09:19.660 --> 00:09:24.670
Do you think she'll choose 09?
Or to terminate life support?

00:09:24.670 --> 00:09:27.460
Maybe we shouldn't tell her
about that second option.

00:09:27.960 --> 00:09:31.800
So, what I smelled was memory suicide, eh?

00:09:31.800 --> 00:09:37.560
In his mind, he probably sees killing a girl
along with his own memories as romantic.

00:09:37.560 --> 00:09:39.220
Everyone dies alone.

00:09:39.220 --> 00:09:43.600
It's not as if the death of another makes
your own death that much more valuable.

00:09:50.190 --> 00:09:52.820
Why me?

00:09:52.820 --> 00:09:55.360
Make your choice.

00:09:56.700 --> 00:09:59.620
You have that right.

00:10:03.460 --> 00:10:06.420
Or would I be better off dead?

00:10:09.210 --> 00:10:10.850
Is it all right to keep living?

00:10:22.270 --> 00:10:24.760
I don't want to die.

00:11:50.310 --> 00:11:52.480
You're awake, I see.

00:11:56.440 --> 00:11:58.320
I'm Dr. Easter.

00:11:58.320 --> 00:12:02.070
I'm in charge of your repairs-- er, your
primary physician, I should say.

00:12:02.070 --> 00:12:05.580
This is my hideout.
It used to be a morgue.

00:12:05.580 --> 00:12:09.420
They say they stored 800 bodies here.
Can you believe that?

00:12:09.420 --> 00:12:12.960
With 800 corpses to fiddle with,
I'm like a kid in a candy store.

00:12:12.960 --> 00:12:16.960
Um, I'd feel a lot better
if you'd turn the lights back on.

00:12:26.600 --> 00:12:29.020
Say "Ah."

00:12:29.480 --> 00:12:32.100
Ah!

00:12:35.190 --> 00:12:38.610
Hm, just as I thought...
Can you talk?

00:12:40.740 --> 00:12:44.620
It was simple enough to regenerate your
sense of smell and eardrums, but this...

00:12:44.620 --> 00:12:47.660
Well, I'll think of a way
to fix it soon enough.

00:12:47.660 --> 00:12:50.660
Is there any pain or itching
in your skin?

00:12:53.130 --> 00:12:58.130
We did a legally-prescribed Q&A with your
subconscious while you were comatose.

00:12:58.130 --> 00:13:01.930
"Do you want to live?" "Do you wish to
exercise your rights?" That sort of thing.

00:13:01.930 --> 00:13:08.100
And your subconscious chose 09.
Mardock Scramble 09.

00:13:08.100 --> 00:13:10.640
That's an emergency ordinance
to preserve life...

00:13:10.640 --> 00:13:13.600
...that gives special dispensation to use
technology that's otherwise forbidden.

00:13:13.600 --> 00:13:16.900
I used to work at a military
space development site, you see.

00:13:16.900 --> 00:13:19.730
I developed that new skin
of yours, too.

00:13:19.730 --> 00:13:26.280
But the wars ended, and now I'm proving
my usefulness as an 09 case officer.

00:13:26.280 --> 00:13:32.240
If I fail to do that, I'll be thrown into prison
for the crime of human experimentation.

00:13:32.240 --> 00:13:36.250
That skin of yours is also
meant to protect you.

00:13:36.250 --> 00:13:42.170
So... if you give your consent, your Life
Support Program will get underway.

00:13:42.170 --> 00:13:47.760
Follow me? We want you to name us
as your case officers for this case.

00:13:52.690 --> 00:13:54.140
Whose case?

00:13:54.140 --> 00:13:56.650
Shell-Septinos.

00:13:56.650 --> 00:14:00.400
He's a Show gambler, as well as
a shrewd casino manager.

00:14:02.400 --> 00:14:04.320
He's behind this case.

00:14:04.320 --> 00:14:09.120
He works under the auspices of a certain
huge conglomerate. October Corp.

00:14:09.120 --> 00:14:10.530
They're our archenemy.

00:14:11.250 --> 00:14:13.030
Enemy?

00:14:13.790 --> 00:14:18.500
They're in a business that's allowed to use
banned technologies outside of 09 cases.

00:14:18.500 --> 00:14:23.800
Amusements and pleasure.
That's October Corp's usefulness.

00:14:23.800 --> 00:14:27.470
Shell is the man who launders
their dirty money.

00:14:27.470 --> 00:14:30.640
We'll keep you safe.
We'll catch him.

00:14:30.640 --> 00:14:35.900
The authorities will pay a reward for solving
the case, and we'll split it with you 50-50.

00:14:35.900 --> 00:14:39.640
You'll begin a new life.
What do you say?

00:14:42.800 --> 00:14:44.010
What about the mouse?

00:14:44.010 --> 00:14:45.490
What?

00:14:45.490 --> 00:14:49.490
The mouse. It was cute, talked,
and had golden fur.

00:14:49.490 --> 00:14:52.870
You were conscious for that?
What amazing aptitude!

00:14:52.870 --> 00:14:56.200
Come on out, Oeufcocque!
The lady wants to see you!

00:14:57.330 --> 00:15:00.250
That half-cooked furball...

00:15:05.050 --> 00:15:08.920
It's impolite to scare a lady, Doctor.

00:15:08.920 --> 00:15:11.680
He was also developed for space use.

00:15:11.680 --> 00:15:16.350
He's a universal item, something
that can Turn into any object.

00:15:21.190 --> 00:15:25.650
Good evening, young lady.
You don't have an aversion to mice?

00:15:25.650 --> 00:15:27.860
If you do, I can turn back into a radio.

00:15:27.860 --> 00:15:31.700
I can become a radio, a television,
anything you care to name.

00:15:31.700 --> 00:15:34.290
What are you blathering about?
We're talking about the case, not--

00:15:34.290 --> 00:15:36.960
She's lost everything.

00:15:36.960 --> 00:15:39.700
A little mental TLC is called for
first, don't you think?

00:15:40.540 --> 00:15:42.210
What should I do?

00:15:42.800 --> 00:15:46.710
You need me to...
agree to help you?

00:15:47.630 --> 00:15:53.720
You catch on quick! Grab hold of
Oeufcocque there and think about Shell.

00:16:17.040 --> 00:16:20.250
I'm amazed it took such
an accurate form.

00:16:20.250 --> 00:16:23.160
That's the physical evidence
of your heart's desire.

00:16:23.710 --> 00:16:28.670
Based on this, we'll take down Shell,
smash October Corp, and--

00:16:30.260 --> 00:16:31.170
Hey, wait!

00:16:36.680 --> 00:16:40.560
W-What the hell did you do that for?
Are you pining for him or something?

00:16:40.560 --> 00:16:42.350
That's not it.

00:16:42.940 --> 00:16:45.560
She hasn't cracked the shell
around her heart, that's all.

00:16:46.320 --> 00:16:49.070
There are too many things
that cause her pain.

00:16:49.450 --> 00:16:51.070
What are you talking about?

00:16:51.740 --> 00:16:54.450
We're the ones who saved her life.

00:16:54.450 --> 00:16:58.500
We have a responsibility to work
with her to find meaning in it.

00:16:58.500 --> 00:17:04.830
My usefulness right now is to make sure
she doesn't choose to abandon that life.

00:17:21.980 --> 00:17:24.310
So, how does it feel to be reborn?

00:17:24.310 --> 00:17:26.900
Like I woke up from a long dream.

00:17:26.900 --> 00:17:28.650
Memory preservation.

00:17:28.650 --> 00:17:32.820
I have memories extracted, recorded,
and deleted from my head.

00:17:32.820 --> 00:17:35.360
Apparently, my brain would rot if I didn't.

00:17:35.990 --> 00:17:38.490
Is there any chance of the
doctors copying the data?

00:17:38.490 --> 00:17:42.210
Beats me. To me, it's all stuff
that happened in a dream.

00:17:42.210 --> 00:17:47.870
Of course, new memories means that
everything is in place to make my deal.

00:17:48.670 --> 00:17:54.510
The chips are my memories. And I have
you in my hand as my trump card.

00:17:54.510 --> 00:17:58.140
To humans, memories are a precious,
irreplaceable thing.

00:17:58.140 --> 00:18:00.390
But me, I'm fine with being empty.

00:18:00.390 --> 00:18:02.810
I'll be filled up later.

00:18:02.810 --> 00:18:05.890
A vessel meant to be filled
with glory, that's me.

00:18:07.650 --> 00:18:10.400
A Scramble 09 has been issued.

00:18:10.400 --> 00:18:13.950
Rune-Balot?
Who's this girl?

00:18:13.950 --> 00:18:16.200
A girl from your dream
that ought to be dead.

00:18:16.200 --> 00:18:17.910
My dream?

00:18:17.910 --> 00:18:22.370
The raw blue diamond material that I
thought was collected is alive and kicking?

00:18:22.370 --> 00:18:24.790
A preliminary legal deal has been struck.

00:18:24.790 --> 00:18:29.500
Some filthy ambulance chaser
is behind this, I take it?

00:18:29.500 --> 00:18:33.880
Oeufcocque-Penteano.
I've worked with him before.

00:18:34.720 --> 00:18:37.140
He might have sniffed out your deal.

00:18:37.140 --> 00:18:41.140
That, or the woman caught his eye and
he decided to use her to come after me.

00:18:42.310 --> 00:18:46.890
This is my game. And it's yours, too.

00:18:46.890 --> 00:18:50.150
In the event of the litigant's death
or disappearance,

00:18:50.150 --> 00:18:52.900
...the case will be closed as unresolved.

00:18:54.030 --> 00:18:56.030
About the doctors...

00:18:56.740 --> 00:19:02.080
It's definitely not a good idea for someone
other than me to hold my chips.

00:19:02.080 --> 00:19:03.160
Understood.

00:19:03.790 --> 00:19:09.920
It's strange. I can't remember that girl,
but one of my fingers is throbbing.

00:19:09.920 --> 00:19:13.920
Was she so special that I wanted to
turn her into an engagement ring?

00:19:14.420 --> 00:19:20.260
Memories of a woman... They're always
trying to destroy my brain.

00:19:20.260 --> 00:19:22.970
She's nothing but a mere woman...

00:19:23.560 --> 00:19:27.480
A "mere" 20 gram bullet will kill a man.

00:19:27.480 --> 00:19:29.930
Get that ring to me.

00:19:35.360 --> 00:19:39.360
Can we put off
Balot's court appearance?

00:19:39.360 --> 00:19:43.040
What do you mean? I just
sent in all our records!

00:19:43.040 --> 00:19:47.460
You want me to put the egg back
in the shell after I've cracked it?

00:19:47.460 --> 00:19:49.070
The egg isn't fried just yet.

00:19:49.070 --> 00:19:50.080
Wha--?

00:19:52.290 --> 00:19:54.210
You aborted the file transfer?

00:19:54.790 --> 00:19:57.470
Your aptitude is something else.

00:19:57.470 --> 00:20:01.470
But why? Do you want to stay
holed up in here forever?

00:20:01.470 --> 00:20:03.390
If you don't fulfill your
courtroom obligations,

00:20:03.390 --> 00:20:06.720
...all you can do is sit here and wait for
the bad guys to send hit men after you!

00:20:07.640 --> 00:20:09.220
I have no one on my side.

00:20:09.810 --> 00:20:13.610
Is that your way of saying
that you can't trust us?

00:20:13.610 --> 00:20:15.300
I don't want to be betrayed.

00:20:15.300 --> 00:20:17.280
We'd never--

00:20:17.280 --> 00:20:21.240
You've been peeking at me
this whole time.

00:20:22.950 --> 00:20:26.740
You brought me back to life and raped me.

00:20:26.740 --> 00:20:28.030
Raped you?!

00:20:28.030 --> 00:20:31.540
Ah, Doctor... Um. Well.

00:20:32.210 --> 00:20:35.800
Then allow me to provide
absolutely full disclosure.

00:20:35.800 --> 00:20:40.590
Firstly, we gave top priority to
the preservation of your life.

00:20:40.590 --> 00:20:43.510
However, we couldn't take you
to a hospital.

00:20:43.510 --> 00:20:47.060
Your enemy would find you, and you
would be finished on the spot.

00:20:47.060 --> 00:20:49.430
And that is where I came in.

00:20:49.430 --> 00:20:53.480
To save your life, my technology
was necessary. Agreed?

00:20:54.690 --> 00:20:59.610
Secondly, it was necessary to give you
the ability to resist.

00:20:59.610 --> 00:21:01.200
Ability to resist?

00:21:01.200 --> 00:21:04.620
Self-defense techniques
and the ability to use a gun.

00:21:04.620 --> 00:21:07.160
I don't want to become a soldier.

00:21:07.870 --> 00:21:11.870
While you were comatose, we presented
your subconscious mind...

00:21:11.870 --> 00:21:15.590
...with all of our technology and plans.

00:21:15.590 --> 00:21:18.630
You chose your current situation.

00:21:20.050 --> 00:21:22.010
I've heard that excuse before.

00:21:22.010 --> 00:21:27.640
You men are always saying,
"You know you wanted it, too" to me.

00:21:30.010 --> 00:21:34.560
I also know that you aren't lying to me.

00:21:35.430 --> 00:21:38.030
I'll leave you in Oeufcocque's capable paws.

00:21:38.030 --> 00:21:42.110
I know what I NEED to do,
but not how...

00:21:42.110 --> 00:21:45.160
How to rebuild a 15 year old girl's body...

00:21:45.160 --> 00:21:48.740
...and how to get her to go to court.

00:21:49.240 --> 00:21:53.240
So, what do you want
to do now, Balot?

00:21:54.790 --> 00:21:56.920
The clothes she ordered have arrived.

00:21:56.920 --> 00:22:00.210
She says she wants to put them on
and go out and get lunch.

00:22:00.210 --> 00:22:03.180
We'll also cancel her doctored ID
while we're out.

00:22:03.180 --> 00:22:06.260
So you don't really want
to stay cooped up, huh?

00:22:06.260 --> 00:22:08.180
The bad guys will spot you.

00:22:08.180 --> 00:22:11.720
It will be a good opportunity for her
to experience my usefulness firsthand.

00:22:17.360 --> 00:22:18.980
Here, take this.

00:22:23.450 --> 00:22:28.240
I applied with the Welfare Benefits Bureau.
Consider those your assets for now.

00:22:28.240 --> 00:22:31.450
I don't know the PIN,
so ask Oeufcocque for it.

00:22:31.450 --> 00:22:35.170
And here's your medicine.
Make sure you take it.

00:22:35.170 --> 00:22:38.210
Patches of your skin are still unstable.

00:22:38.210 --> 00:22:42.130
Oh, and it's supposed to
get chilly again today.

00:22:42.130 --> 00:22:45.380
Don't get careless and catch a cold.

00:22:46.130 --> 00:22:50.130
I'm praying that you learn to use
Oeufcocque properly without abusing him.

00:23:02.360 --> 00:23:05.110
I think it's fine.

00:23:05.110 --> 00:23:06.610
It's not too tight?

00:23:15.000 --> 00:23:17.700
I am proud of my white lab coat...

00:23:17.700 --> 00:23:21.170
but your clothes look as good.

00:23:23.510 --> 00:23:26.420
So, shall we go?

00:23:30.300 --> 00:23:35.430
Looks like our new client will be
telling us how things should be.

00:23:35.430 --> 00:23:37.850
I'm sorry about earlier.

00:23:37.850 --> 00:23:39.180
For what?

00:23:39.770 --> 00:23:41.730
I hurt your feelings.

00:23:41.730 --> 00:23:45.190
But thank you.
I'll repay you the money.

00:23:45.190 --> 00:23:49.950
Um, stop using Oeufcocque's voice
when you talk, all right?

00:23:49.950 --> 00:23:51.450
It's kinda creepy.

00:23:52.030 --> 00:23:56.080
I can't remember what
my own voice sounds like.

00:23:56.080 --> 00:23:58.950
You'll get it back.
One step at a time.

00:24:39.250 --> 00:24:40.580
Stop that, Balot!

00:24:43.500 --> 00:24:47.800
Do you feel threatened by the traffic lights?
To a life-threatening extent?

00:24:47.800 --> 00:24:50.220
But you didn't stop me last time.

00:24:50.220 --> 00:24:51.960
I was observing your self-control.

00:24:52.760 --> 00:24:56.470
What about a seat belt?
Do you want to go on a high-speed joyride?

00:24:56.470 --> 00:25:00.230
Why are you so angry all of a sudden?
ls it because I fiddled with the lights?

00:25:00.230 --> 00:25:02.060
I'm not angry.

00:25:02.060 --> 00:25:06.290
If someone is hit by a car because you
had tampered with the lights,

00:25:06.290 --> 00:25:08.980
...you would be the one hurt, not me.

00:25:08.980 --> 00:25:10.980
Please don't be angry.

00:25:11.660 --> 00:25:15.160
I want you to decide for yourself
which rules to obey.

00:25:15.160 --> 00:25:17.160
You have a high aptitude.

00:25:17.160 --> 00:25:19.200
Don't say it like that.

00:25:19.200 --> 00:25:20.580
Sure.

00:25:21.210 --> 00:25:23.630
I won't do it again.

00:25:23.630 --> 00:25:26.250
I have no desire to force
rules on you arbitrarily.

00:25:26.250 --> 00:25:28.800
When I tell you "No", it will be a
fundamental line that I will not cross,

00:25:28.800 --> 00:25:31.800
...as well as a matter of your safety.

00:25:31.800 --> 00:25:34.970
And for my part, I would never do
something that I'd say "No" to.

00:25:34.970 --> 00:25:38.970
Can we agree on that as a promise
between the two of us?

00:25:39.850 --> 00:25:40.680
Yes.

00:25:49.320 --> 00:25:50.820
You're good with those.

00:25:50.820 --> 00:25:54.950
Of all the girls, I was
the best at using these.

00:25:54.950 --> 00:25:57.200
They said I was good with my hands.

00:25:57.200 --> 00:26:00.250
That I might be good at
digging up fossils and stuff.

00:26:00.250 --> 00:26:04.830
If you ever want to do something in
the future, that would be wonderful.

00:26:04.830 --> 00:26:09.500
I don't know. Maybe I just
can't think of anything else.

00:26:12.510 --> 00:26:16.800
You should buy a few things
that strike your fancy.

00:26:17.510 --> 00:26:19.390
Stop, Balot!

00:26:24.770 --> 00:26:27.270
I'll keep watch out here.
Go on inside.

00:26:45.830 --> 00:26:48.300
You were in there a long time.

00:26:48.300 --> 00:26:51.340
There was a camera in there for peeping.

00:26:51.340 --> 00:26:54.510
A camera to illegally perceive
women visually, eh?

00:26:54.510 --> 00:26:56.720
Do you really get it?

00:26:56.720 --> 00:27:01.600
At the moment, you're irritated as well
as embarrassed. Frustrated, as well.

00:27:01.600 --> 00:27:03.710
Those are the odors you are giving off.

00:27:03.710 --> 00:27:04.980
Odors?

00:27:04.980 --> 00:27:09.270
Mice can tell what someone is feeling
by their smell. Didn't you know?

00:27:09.270 --> 00:27:14.770
I know exactly how much I'd get paid
to appear on that camera willingly.

00:27:15.200 --> 00:27:20.900
Ah. I don't know what you're feeling.
I'm not human, after all.

00:27:22.160 --> 00:27:25.500
You're sweeter than a human.

00:27:25.500 --> 00:27:30.000
There's a café upstairs.
We should be able to work there.

00:27:31.870 --> 00:27:36.010
We have control of the Citizen ID
registration that Shell falsified.

00:27:36.010 --> 00:27:39.420
According to this, you're a
19 year old bank employee.

00:27:39.420 --> 00:27:42.260
He moves money by means of
fictional fund establishment forms.

00:27:42.260 --> 00:27:45.310
This is clearly one of his
money laundering routes.

00:27:45.310 --> 00:27:49.310
It is set to go into effect
if you access your file.

00:27:50.020 --> 00:27:52.520
My death is another trigger?

00:27:52.520 --> 00:27:58.320
Yes, but when this case was established,
we were given the right to break into them.

00:27:58.320 --> 00:28:02.240
I'll go through the items one by one.
Is that all right?

00:28:03.080 --> 00:28:04.740
Where is your older brother?

00:28:04.740 --> 00:28:06.740
In prison.

00:28:07.120 --> 00:28:08.790
Your parents are alive, correct?

00:28:08.790 --> 00:28:11.880
Yes, but both are in the hospital.

00:28:11.880 --> 00:28:14.050
What school did you attend?

00:28:14.050 --> 00:28:18.090
I can't go to school here,
because I need my parents' signature.

00:28:18.300 --> 00:28:20.210
Your parents, they--

00:28:20.210 --> 00:28:23.760
They don't think of me as their child.

00:28:27.260 --> 00:28:29.810
I have all the documents I need.

00:28:29.810 --> 00:28:33.360
Now, if Shell's memories are
on file somewhere...

00:28:33.360 --> 00:28:35.820
I can't take any more of this...

00:28:35.820 --> 00:28:37.280
You were very brave.

00:28:37.280 --> 00:28:40.610
All we need to do now is send these
to the Ministry of Justice.

00:28:40.610 --> 00:28:44.410
We're going to show people? Tell them
what my past was really like?

00:28:44.410 --> 00:28:45.140
Balot...

00:28:45.140 --> 00:28:46.580
Wait!

00:28:46.580 --> 00:28:51.120
Please. Understand what
this is like for me.

00:28:52.290 --> 00:28:58.510
How about thinking of it like this?
What we're doing is digging up fossils.

00:28:58.510 --> 00:29:02.470
Even the most fearsome creatures
have turned to stone while sleeping.

00:29:02.470 --> 00:29:06.260
The one who is really alive
in the here and now is you.

00:29:07.350 --> 00:29:10.560
You want to hurt me that badly?

00:29:12.020 --> 00:29:16.860
I can delete the files. If that's the best
way for you to deal with the fossils.

00:29:16.860 --> 00:29:18.770
But that would mess
everything up, wouldn't it?

00:29:18.770 --> 00:29:22.860
If you tell me "No", I won't do it.

00:29:29.450 --> 00:29:32.790
Go ahead, Oeufcocque.

00:29:45.550 --> 00:29:48.470
Do you think that I'm messed up?

00:29:48.470 --> 00:29:50.180
Messed up? Why?

00:29:50.180 --> 00:29:54.310
Because I'm a girl who takes money
from men and lets them touch her.

00:29:54.310 --> 00:30:01.360
No. To my knowledge, many masculine
notions are built upon that sort of system.

00:30:01.360 --> 00:30:05.740
If you are "messed up," it means that
something much more significant is messed up.

00:30:06.990 --> 00:30:09.620
Mind if I talk about myself a little?

00:30:09.620 --> 00:30:11.280
Tell me all about it.

00:30:12.120 --> 00:30:15.710
When the club I was working at
was shut down by the police,

00:30:15.710 --> 00:30:18.500
one of the officers asked me something.

00:30:19.340 --> 00:30:22.110
Why be a prostitute, of all things?

00:30:22.110 --> 00:30:23.500
Because I'm not a virgin.

00:30:25.430 --> 00:30:27.300
Is something funny?

00:30:27.300 --> 00:30:31.260
And when did you give this
lucky fella your virginity?

00:30:31.600 --> 00:30:36.270
Lucky? I didn't know you could
think of it that way.

00:30:36.270 --> 00:30:39.440
To my father. I was 12.

00:30:40.230 --> 00:30:45.400
Don't you ever think about
touching your own daughter?

00:30:47.400 --> 00:30:49.910
That's messed up.

00:30:49.910 --> 00:30:53.040
I don't know what was messed up about it.

00:30:53.040 --> 00:30:56.000
I just knew that I didn't
have anyone on my side.

00:30:56.000 --> 00:30:59.840
After that, Shell came
and he said he would love me.

00:30:59.840 --> 00:31:02.420
That's why I got into Shell's car.

00:31:02.800 --> 00:31:05.090
Do you think I'm messed up?

00:31:05.090 --> 00:31:07.180
I don't know.

00:31:07.180 --> 00:31:10.390
I'm merely a mouse whose intelligence
has been boosted to human levels.

00:31:10.390 --> 00:31:12.720
There are those who would say
that I am "messed up".

00:31:12.720 --> 00:31:15.180
You? Why?

00:31:15.180 --> 00:31:19.060
To them, a being such as
myself is crazy.

00:31:19.060 --> 00:31:22.280
I don't really understand
what I am, either.

00:31:22.280 --> 00:31:25.860
I was created by the military's order, but the
research itself was destroyed.

00:31:25.860 --> 00:31:29.570
At the moment, my existence
is tolerated, just barely,

00:31:29.570 --> 00:31:32.200
...by my continuously proving
my usefulness to society.

00:31:32.660 --> 00:31:35.410
That's why you're helping me?

00:31:35.410 --> 00:31:38.750
To get them to allow you to live?

00:31:41.500 --> 00:31:42.700
What's wrong?

00:31:42.700 --> 00:31:45.340
I smell hostility. Several sources.

00:31:46.210 --> 00:31:49.090
They must have traced back
that camera feed in the café.

00:31:49.090 --> 00:31:50.080
What do we do?

00:31:50.080 --> 00:31:52.180
Take me in your hand.

00:31:54.060 --> 00:31:55.640
Do not worry.

00:31:55.640 --> 00:32:01.310
I'm a universal item that was developed
to be the ultimate hand-to-hand weapon.

00:32:07.900 --> 00:32:09.020
They're coming this way!

00:32:09.020 --> 00:32:10.650
Thrust out the hand I'm on.

00:32:18.160 --> 00:32:18.990
Why you!

00:32:20.540 --> 00:32:22.000
Wha--?

00:32:25.260 --> 00:32:28.340
All right, let's go back
to the parking garage.

00:32:29.920 --> 00:32:31.420
Another group is already here.

00:32:32.130 --> 00:32:33.800
Are we going to knock them out, too?

00:32:33.800 --> 00:32:36.680
No, if they don't try anything, we'll go home.

00:32:36.680 --> 00:32:38.650
You really think nothing will happen?

00:32:38.650 --> 00:32:40.470
A mouse can dream, can't he?

00:32:40.470 --> 00:32:43.570
I never know if I can count on you!

00:32:43.570 --> 00:32:47.440
We can't have that, can we?
You're the witness to my usefulness.

00:32:47.440 --> 00:32:48.690
Here they come.

00:32:53.830 --> 00:32:55.450
See? Something IS happening!

00:32:55.450 --> 00:32:58.450
Let's try having you evade them.
I'll feed you directions.

00:32:58.450 --> 00:33:01.540
Fasten your seat belt
and floor the accelerator.

00:33:01.540 --> 00:33:03.710
I've never driven before!

00:33:04.250 --> 00:33:07.670
There's a first time for everything.

00:33:24.390 --> 00:33:26.770
Good, we've evaded them peacefully.

00:33:26.770 --> 00:33:30.030
You call going the wrong way
down the street "peacefully"?

00:33:30.030 --> 00:33:33.660
I can't very well Turn into a rocket
launcher and blow them to pieces.

00:33:33.660 --> 00:33:34.630
You can do that?

00:33:34.630 --> 00:33:35.780
It's a crime!

00:33:35.780 --> 00:33:39.280
I'd be destroyed the very next day.

00:33:39.280 --> 00:33:41.950
Now, let's ditch the rest.

00:33:52.460 --> 00:33:55.850
We've completely given that first bunch
the slip, but I'm getting a strange odor.

00:33:55.850 --> 00:33:58.640
It's as if we're being watched...

00:34:05.890 --> 00:34:09.400
I request disclosure of information
between fellow case officers.

00:34:09.400 --> 00:34:14.910
If you refuse, the public rental car agency
will testify as to your poor attitude.

00:34:14.910 --> 00:34:17.580
What? What is he talking about?

00:34:17.580 --> 00:34:21.410
Fellow case officers negotiate in order
to reach a peaceful settlement.

00:34:21.410 --> 00:34:24.500
Refusal to do so
reflects poorly at trial.

00:34:24.500 --> 00:34:26.330
What will we do?

00:34:26.330 --> 00:34:28.920
We'll speak with him for a while.

00:34:33.000 --> 00:34:37.300
Relax. As long as I'm here,
he won't do anything to you.

00:34:42.850 --> 00:34:46.190
That's your user now, Oeufcocque?

00:34:46.190 --> 00:34:49.060
What is the information
you wanted to disclose, Boiled?

00:34:49.570 --> 00:34:52.810
Revoke the Life Support Program.

00:34:52.810 --> 00:34:58.570
That's intimidation. You still consider
that to be a viable solution, do you?

00:34:58.570 --> 00:35:03.160
Tell me what you will you do
in the event of the litigant's death.

00:35:03.160 --> 00:35:06.000
All charges will go forward unchanged.

00:35:06.000 --> 00:35:08.710
You think killing her will end this?

00:35:09.540 --> 00:35:10.580
Are you scared?

00:35:12.460 --> 00:35:15.840
If you don't want to die, drop the suit.

00:35:15.840 --> 00:35:19.840
Don't listen to him, Balot. If you give up,
there won't be anyone to protect you.

00:35:22.510 --> 00:35:27.520
The summary hearing is in three days.
You'll find out the rest at the proceedings.

00:35:28.140 --> 00:35:34.650
I'm looking forward to holding you
in my hand again, Oeufcocque.

00:35:48.880 --> 00:35:51.540
Do you know that person?

00:35:51.540 --> 00:35:56.130
Dimsdale-Boiled.
He used to be my partner.

00:35:56.130 --> 00:35:57.430
Your partner?

00:35:57.430 --> 00:36:00.760
Now we're enemies.

00:36:00.760 --> 00:36:02.390
I don't want to die!

00:36:02.390 --> 00:36:06.300
Have faith in me.
By protecting you, I'll prove my--

00:36:06.300 --> 00:36:08.600
Why me?

00:36:14.690 --> 00:36:16.900
You aren't messed up.

00:36:16.900 --> 00:36:20.660
You haven't made any mistakes.
You haven't done anything wrong.

00:36:20.660 --> 00:36:24.410
You haven't done anything
to deserve being killed.

00:36:24.410 --> 00:36:29.580
I want to serve you as my user
and resolve your case.

00:36:29.580 --> 00:36:32.130
My case?

00:36:32.130 --> 00:36:34.250
That's right.

00:36:34.960 --> 00:36:39.510
Will they ask about what happened
between me and my father at the trial?

00:36:39.510 --> 00:36:42.470
They'll talk about what I did to men,
and what men did to me,

00:36:42.470 --> 00:36:45.850
...the kind of lifestyle
my work let me lead,

00:36:45.850 --> 00:36:48.310
...and say that these men
didn't do anything wrong.

00:36:48.310 --> 00:36:51.270
I don't intend to let them pursue
that line of reasoning.

00:36:51.270 --> 00:36:56.820
I want to help you two.
Do you believe me?

00:36:56.820 --> 00:36:58.240
Yes.

00:36:58.240 --> 00:37:02.870
I want an excuse. One that
convinces me that I'm not damaged goods.

00:37:02.870 --> 00:37:08.660
I don't care if I die. But at the same time,
I don't WANT to die, either.

00:37:08.660 --> 00:37:13.000
I don't want to die while
I'm feeling this way.

00:37:13.000 --> 00:37:18.970
You've fought by yourself all this time.
That in itself is no mean feat.

00:37:18.970 --> 00:37:20.680
What do you mean?

00:37:20.680 --> 00:37:24.510
You've endured, even as you
were being forced to submit.

00:37:24.510 --> 00:37:28.930
That is a difficult battle that calls for
courage and perseverance.

00:37:28.930 --> 00:37:31.980
I'll fight at your side from now on.

00:37:31.980 --> 00:37:34.480
It may not be a manner
that you are familiar with.

00:37:34.480 --> 00:37:38.110
But I also want you to understand
how we wage our battles.

00:37:38.110 --> 00:37:40.950
That's your excuse?

00:37:40.950 --> 00:37:46.200
I am the same as you. I'm on a quest
to understand who and what I am.

00:37:46.200 --> 00:37:49.540
In this city, I'm casting
my own shadow on trouble...

00:37:49.540 --> 00:37:52.990
...that's about to be indelibly burned in.

00:37:57.500 --> 00:38:00.300
There aren't any prospects
out there for me.

00:38:00.300 --> 00:38:04.140
All the girls I know didn't
have any, either,

00:38:04.140 --> 00:38:08.260
...and ended getting chewed up
and spit out by drugs or men.

00:38:08.260 --> 00:38:13.260
All they want is an excuse
to keep living, even in such a situation.

00:38:14.230 --> 00:38:16.860
Love me, Oeufcocque.

00:38:16.860 --> 00:38:19.070
Look, I-- What?

00:38:19.070 --> 00:38:23.070
Give me an excuse.
I want to be useful to you.

00:38:23.070 --> 00:38:26.780
Even at the trial, I'll do
anything you tell me to do.

00:38:26.780 --> 00:38:28.580
So please, love me.

00:38:28.580 --> 00:38:34.080
W-Wait! Look, will that give you closure?

00:38:34.080 --> 00:38:37.410
I want to be loved by someone like you.

00:38:38.630 --> 00:38:42.760
You forced me to Turn?
You can crack my protection?

00:38:42.760 --> 00:38:46.260
What am I to you?

00:38:46.260 --> 00:38:49.310
Well, y-you're my client,
and the case litigant.

00:38:49.310 --> 00:38:51.300
If you're dissatisfied with me--

00:38:51.300 --> 00:38:54.140
I don't care about any of that!
I don't care!

00:38:54.140 --> 00:38:57.730
Wait! Wait, wait!
Look! Look, I'm a mouse!

00:38:57.730 --> 00:39:02.440
Do you think I can turn into a human male
if you wish hard enough? Well, I can't!

00:39:02.440 --> 00:39:05.610
I know that!
You're a sweet little mouse.

00:39:05.610 --> 00:39:08.320
Do you think I'm messed up, too?

00:39:08.320 --> 00:39:11.740
Look, do you think I'm
your pet or something?

00:39:15.500 --> 00:39:17.830
"My new partner."

00:39:18.500 --> 00:39:24.500
You said that here. You looked at me
and said I would be your new partner.

00:39:24.500 --> 00:39:28.640
You were aware of your surroundings
in the state you were in?

00:39:28.640 --> 00:39:31.140
That's an extraordinary quality.

00:39:31.140 --> 00:39:34.760
Perhaps that is why my Snark capabilities
adapted themselves to you so well...

00:39:40.900 --> 00:39:46.070
Um... I make a great many demands
of the humans who use me.

00:39:46.070 --> 00:39:49.360
That's what caused me to turn against
my former partner.

00:39:49.360 --> 00:39:54.280
If you would like to be my partner
while being my client at the same time...

00:39:55.000 --> 00:39:59.200
I'll do anything you say.
I'll even appear in court.

00:40:00.170 --> 00:40:02.750
Well, it's not like I don't sense there
will be some differences of opinion...

00:40:02.750 --> 00:40:05.840
Still, put 'er there, Partner.

00:40:05.840 --> 00:40:09.220
Balot. Please call me by name.

00:40:09.220 --> 00:40:12.680
Ah. I look forward to working
with you, Balot.

00:40:12.680 --> 00:40:16.850
I'm Oeufcocque. I'm licensed
as an 09 case officer.

00:40:16.850 --> 00:40:20.190
The Ministry of Justice thinks
of me as human, but--

00:40:20.190 --> 00:40:22.520
I think you are, too.

00:40:33.660 --> 00:40:38.160
Fits perfectly.
Did you pick it out, Balot?

00:40:38.910 --> 00:40:43.460
She says it was her condition for
appearing in court, Doctor.

00:40:43.460 --> 00:40:48.170
If she didn't like my clothes,
she should have mentioned it earlier.

00:40:48.170 --> 00:40:51.420
Oops, that's not good.
I need to examine you again.

00:40:51.420 --> 00:40:55.890
I tell you, systems that are in the middle of
development are such a pain in the ass...

00:40:55.890 --> 00:40:57.640
What are you up to?

00:40:57.640 --> 00:41:02.680
I've been trying out different
ways of restoring Balot's voice.

00:41:02.680 --> 00:41:06.190
You don't want to be stuck using
substitutes forever, right?

00:41:12.370 --> 00:41:14.580
W-What was that all about?

00:41:14.580 --> 00:41:15.740
I'm not sure.

00:41:16.330 --> 00:41:20.580
In addition to joy, she also smelled
of negative emotions and fear.

00:41:20.580 --> 00:41:23.290
You don't suppose she's beginning to have
misgivings about our usefulness, do you?

00:41:23.290 --> 00:41:25.080
Hang on, look at this.

00:41:26.000 --> 00:41:27.460
This is...

00:41:27.460 --> 00:41:31.590
a human trait that we can interpret
as an expression of affection, right?

00:41:31.590 --> 00:41:33.590
We can indeed, Oeufcocque.

00:41:33.590 --> 00:41:38.090
She seems to have taken
quite a shine to us, wouldn't you say?

00:41:42.220 --> 00:41:47.610
You simply press three buttons.
Yes, No, or Silence.

00:41:47.610 --> 00:41:50.730
You can refuse to let anyone take notes.

00:41:50.730 --> 00:41:53.160
You clean up nicely, Easter.

00:41:53.160 --> 00:41:56.860
You'd make my life easier if you
dressed like this all the time.

00:41:56.860 --> 00:42:02.540
Let's go over her outfit next. She's a little
too pretty, if you know what I mean.

00:42:02.540 --> 00:42:06.620
She can't give the impression
that she seduces men.

00:42:09.130 --> 00:42:13.970
Mr. Shell had no intent
of causing her any harm.

00:42:13.970 --> 00:42:18.890
And even if he had, why did
she offer no resistance?

00:42:18.890 --> 00:42:22.390
In light of what she has lost, we--

00:42:22.390 --> 00:42:26.650
I want to convince myself that
I'm doing this for you.

00:42:26.650 --> 00:42:31.900
These are just the proceedings.
The real fight will come afterwards.

00:42:31.900 --> 00:42:36.650
It is at this point that we must
discuss certain shocking matters.

00:42:36.650 --> 00:42:38.990
When she was even younger
than she is now,

00:42:38.990 --> 00:42:43.000
...this woman engaged in sexual relations
with her own father.

00:42:43.000 --> 00:42:45.160
Isn't that right, Rune-Balot?

