<b>kyo mo watashi wa utaou</b>

01:05:34.650 --> 01:05:45.740
<b>何も知らずに 生きてきた</b>

01:05:34.650 --> 01:05:45.740
<b>nani mo shirazuni ikite kita</b>

01:05:45.740 --> 01:05:55.480
<b>わたしは もう迷わない</b>

01:05:45.740 --> 01:05:55.480
<b>watashi wa mou mayou wa nai</b>

01:06:52.530 --> 01:07:03.150
<b>ひかり輝く 幸せを</b>

01:06:52.530 --> 01:07:03.150
<b>hikari kagayaku shiawase wo</b>

01:07:03.970 --> 01:07:15.180
<b>與えたもうた あなた</b>

01:07:03.970 --> 01:07:15.180
<b>ataeta mouta anata</b>

01:07:15.180 --> 01:07:26.210
<b>おおきなみむねに ゆだねましょう</b>

01:07:15.180 --> 01:07:26.210
<b>ookinami mune ni yudane mashou</b>

01:07:26.210 --> 01:07:36.920
<b>續く世界の 平和を</b>

01:07:26.210 --> 01:07:36.920
<b>tsuzuku sekai no heiwa wo</b>

01:07:37.620 --> 01:07:48.640
<b>Amazing grace, how sweet the sound</b>

01:07:48.640 --> 01:07:59.800
<b>That saved a wretch like me</b>

01:07:59.800 --> 01:08:10.820
<b>I once was lost, but now I'm found</b>

01:08:10.820 --> 01:08:23.290
<b>Was blind, but now I see</b>
